* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
core/kit/vendor/** -text

# Vendored third-party data: the Unicode emoji data and CLDR annotations under core/spec/emoji, and the
# emoji catalogue generated from them. Their text is somebody else's (the robot emoji and the em dash are
# data, not our voice), so GitHub and the publish scan treat them as vendored rather than as our prose.
core/spec/emoji/** linguist-vendored
core/app/rules/emoji-data.js linguist-vendored

# The third-party builds the app ships as they came (core/kit/vendor/README.md): Lit, and pdf.js and its worker
# (issue 374). Their text is the package authors', so they are vendored too.
core/kit/vendor/** linguist-vendored
